      "reading_order": 2894,
      "section": "Outdoor Suction Temperature Sensor",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 101.5121,
        "t": 462.82443059999997,
        "r": 498.9113044400009,
        "b": 422.27277
      },
      "content": "The system sets a target discharge temperature according to the outdoor and indoor heat exchanger temperature, and controls the electronic expansion valve opening so that the target discharge temperature can be obtained.",
