        "t": 384.8774944,
        "r": 488.6246440600008,
        "b": 344.32487
      },
      "content": "The discharge pipe thermistor is used for controlling temperature of the discharge pipe. If the temperature of discharge pipe (used in place of the inner temperature of the compressor) rises abnormally, the operating frequency drops or the operation halts.",
