        "t": 228.97633919999998,
        "r": 551.5076986199991,
        "b": 204.113067
      },
      "content": "2.The indoor heat exchanger thermistor is used for preventing freezing.During the cooling operation, if the temperature drops abnormally, the operating frequency becomes lower, then the operation halts.",
